<title>USA: Freeport-McMoRan redeems depositary shrs.</title>
<headline>Freeport-McMoRan redeems depositary shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc said Wednesday it called for redemption all of its outstanding depositary shares, which represent its 7 percent convertible exchangeable preferred stock.</p>
<p>The company said it will pay $26.05, plus $0.2663 representing the amount of accrued and unpaid dividends to the redemption date on each depositary share, for a total payment of $26.3163 per depositary share.</p>
<p>The depositary shares are convertible until 1700 EST on December 27 into shares of class A common stock at a conversion rate equal to about 1.0208 shares of class A common stock per depositary share, the company said.</p>
</text>
